  "solution": {
    "text": "Any general point on the line <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1,5</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3,2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />It must satisfy <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />So, the point of intersection of the plane and the line is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />This point also lies on <math><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />This point also satisfy <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />By taking <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>65</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>26</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>65</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>26</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>38</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>38</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>119</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>11</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>210</mn></math>",
